dloc 1
culture zh-Hans
namespace UObjectToolTips

EDreamUIClickMethod {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#EDreamUIClickMethod
    src   "WHEN a mouse click counts -- UMG's EButtonClickMethod, spelled in our own enum because this header\nmust not include UMG and because .dui, the designer and Blueprint all see a UENUM the same way.\n\nThe distinction is not pedantry: a press-and-drag-away is how a player CANCELS a click on every\ndesktop, and DownAndUp is the only method that honours it. The other three exist for the cases\nthat genuinely want something else -- a key on a virtual keyboard repeating on press, a button\nunder a scrolling list that must not fire when the finger was really scrolling."
    text  "鼠标点击何时生效——UMG 的 EButtonClickMethod，之所以用我们自己的枚举表示，是因为此头文件\n不得包含 UMG，也因为 .dui、设计器和蓝图都会以相同方式识别 UENUM。\n\n这一区分并非吹毛求疵：在每一台桌面设备上，按下后拖离正是玩家取消点击的方式，\n而 DownAndUp 是唯一遵循此行为的方法。其余三种用于确实需要不同行为的场景——\n虚拟键盘上的按键在按下时重复触发，以及滚动列表下的按钮\n在手指实际是在滚动时不得触发。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIClickMethod.DownAndUp {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#EDreamUIClickMethod:DownAndUp
    src   "Press on it and release on it. The desktop's rule, and the default."
    text  "在控件上按下并松开。桌面端的规则，也是默认值。"
    state machine
}

