EUISelectableSelectionState.Focused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#EUISelectableSelectionState:Focused
    src   "Holds keyboard/gamepad focus. Distinct from Hovered: a pointer can rest on one control while\nfocus sits on another, and the two want to look different when both are on screen at once.\nAppended rather than slotted in beside Hovered so no saved asset changes meaning."
