    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:GetInteractable
    src   "This control's OWN flag, without the hierarchy. Read it to find out what was authored here;\nread IsInteractable to find out whether the player can use the thing."
    text  "此控件自身的标志，不考虑层级。读取它可了解此处配置了什么；\n若要了解玩家能否使用该控件，请读取 IsInteractable。"
