UISelectable:GetSelectionState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:GetSelectionState
    src   "The state the pointer flags and the focus say: Disabled, Pressed, Hovered, Focused, else Normal. Focused only while\nthe focus is to be drawn (IsFocusShown, CSS's :focus-visible): a control focused by a click draws Normal once the\npointer leaves it, and IsFocused still says it has the focus."
    text  "由指针标志和焦点得出的状态：Disabled、Pressed、Hovered、Focused，否则为 Normal。仅当需要绘制焦点时才是 Focused\n（IsFocusShown，即 CSS 的 :focus-visible）：通过点击获得焦点的控件在指针离开后\n会绘制为 Normal，而 IsFocused 仍表示它拥有焦点。"
    state machine
}

