    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:IsInteractable
    src   "True only when this control AND the tree above it are all enabled and visible. What the look,\nthe navigation scan and the pointer handlers all ask."
    text  "仅当此控件及其上方的整棵树都已启用且可见时才为 true。外观、\n导航扫描和指针处理程序都以此为准。"
    state machine
}

UISelectable:SetAnimDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:SetAnimDuration
    src   "How long a state change takes, in seconds. Zero snaps.\n\nA setter because a native control has to be able to push it: everything else about how a\ncontrol looks is a style knob, and a transition speed that only a hand-placed behaviour could\nreach is the one part of the feel a project sheet could not state."
    text  "状态变化所需的时间，单位为秒。为零时立即切换。\n\n之所以是设置器，是因为原生控件必须能够推送它：控件外观的其他一切\n都由样式参数控制，而只有手动放置的行为才能触及的过渡速度，\n正是项目样式表无法声明的唯一一部分手感。"
    state machine
}

UISelectable:SetHoveredSound {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:SetHoveredSound
    src   "Nothing is played here and nothing re-applied: a sound describes the NEXT transition, and\nreplaying the current state's to honour a new one would be a noise nobody asked for."
    text  "此处不会播放任何声音，也不会重新应用任何内容：声音描述的是下一次过渡，\n为了遵从新声音而重放当前状态的声音，只会制造没人想要的噪音。"
    state machine
}

UISelectable:SetInteractable {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:SetInteractable
    src   "Turn this control on or off at runtime, and repaint it.\n\nThere was no setter at all: bInteractable was EditAnywhere and nothing else, so the only way to\ndisable a control from game code was UDreamWidget::SetInteractable, which takes the whole\nsubtree out of the raycast -- a different thing, and the wrong one for a button that must stay\nvisible, keep its tooltip and keep blocking what is behind it."
    text  "在运行时开启或关闭此控件，并重绘它。\n\n原先根本没有设置器：bInteractable 只是 EditAnywhere，别无其他，因此从游戏代码\n禁用控件的唯一方式就是 UDreamWidget::SetInteractable，而它会把整个子树\n移出射线检测——这是另一回事，对于必须保持可见、\n保留其工具提示并继续阻挡其后方内容的按钮来说，是错误的做法。"
    state machine
}

UISelectable:SetUseFocusRing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UISelectable.h#UISelectable:SetUseFocusRing
    src   "Off while the ring marks this control, the ring leaves it; on while its focus is drawn, the ring comes."
    text  "关闭时，若光环正标记此控件，光环会离开；开启时，若绘制其焦点，光环就会出现。"
    state machine
}

